{"version":1,"content":"<p>據CNBC報道，英偉達CEO黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)周四在接受採訪時表示，到2029年時，內存晶片供應不太可能出現過剩的情況。過去一周，由於市場擔憂內存晶片供應過剩和需求疲軟，內存晶片股遭到拋售。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583514.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.863296+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"ca28d563decc0be835667b008569f7d3ed388f7a03aab0030c1e0e50254f0dda","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}